## 4. Building a Graduate‑Level Profile

| Element | How to Build |
|---------|--------------|
| **Transcripts** | Add physics‑specific courses (via community college or online) and list them on your transcript. |
| **GRE / Physics Subject Test** | Prepare with *The Princeton Review* or *Magoosh*; aim for top 10 % in the physics subject test. |
| **Research Experience** | Reach out to local universities or research institutes. Offer to help with data analysis, simulations, or literature reviews. |
| **Statement of Purpose (SOP)** | Highlight your journey from English to physics, emphasizing analytical skills and genuine passion. |
| **Letters of Recommendation** | Secure 2‑3 referees from physics courses or research mentors. |

